    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "[[b]]Practical Use on Site[[/b]]"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Workers use binding wire to connect 12mm rods securely before pouring concrete. Without it, the structure may lose alignment."
